"On iOS these rules are kept but match nothing: the owner metadata they test cannot be resolved, so the next rule decides. UID is the exception — it is removed, because a UID rule cannot be built on this platform and keeping it would stop the whole configuration from loading. Use domain, IP, GEOSITE or GEOIP conditions instead." = "在 iOS 上这些规则会保留，但匹配不到任何东西：它们检验的归属元数据无法解析，于是交由下一条规则决定。UID 是例外——它会被移除，因为这个平台上构建不出 UID 规则，留着会让整份配置无法加载。请改用域名、IP、GEOSITE 或 GEOIP 条件。";
"On iOS, process-, inbound-user- and source-app-based rules run but match nothing, because the owner metadata they test cannot be resolved; UID rules are removed at activation. The editor lets you write them and marks them, so the same profile can carry them for a Mac." = "在 iOS 上，基于进程、入站用户、来源 App 的规则会运行但不会匹配，因为它们检查的信息在这里拿不到；UID 规则在激活时被移除。编辑器允许你写入并标注，这样同一份配置可以带着它们给 Mac 用。";
"On iOS, process-, inbound-user- and source-app-based rules run but match nothing, because the owner metadata they test cannot be resolved; UID rules are removed at activation. The structured rule editor rejects all of them up front." = "在 iOS 上，基于进程、入站用户和来源应用的规则会运行但匹配不到任何东西，因为它们检验的归属元数据无法解析；UID 规则会在激活时被移除。结构化规则编辑器会在录入时就拒绝它们。";
"On tvOS, process-, inbound-user- and source-app-based rules run but match nothing, because the owner metadata they test cannot be resolved; UID rules are removed at activation. The editor lets you write them and marks them, so the same profile can carry them for a Mac." = "在 Apple TV 上，基于进程、入站用户、来源 App 的规则会运行但不会匹配，因为它们检查的信息在这里拿不到；UID 规则在激活时被移除。编辑器允许你写入并标注，这样同一份配置可以带着它们给 Mac 用。";
"On tvOS, process-, inbound-user- and source-app-based rules run but match nothing, because the owner metadata they test cannot be resolved; UID rules are removed at activation. The structured rule editor rejects all of them up front." = "在 Apple TV 上，基于进程、入站用户和来源应用的规则会运行但匹配不到任何东西，因为它们检验的归属元数据无法解析；UID 规则会在激活时被移除。结构化规则编辑器会在录入时就拒绝它们。";
