"The captured source is what you pasted. Runtime is the config iOS actually runs — overrides applied and desktop-only surfaces removed — with your own credentials shown. For a profile that is already running, it is the revision that was activated: later edits appear here once you activate it again." = "捕获的源是你粘贴进来的内容。运行时是 iOS 实际运行的配置——已应用覆写、已移除仅桌面端的字段——并显示你自己的凭据。对已经在运行的配置，它是当时激活的那个修订：之后的改动要再激活一次才会出现在这里。";
"The captured source is what you pasted. Runtime is the config macOS actually runs — overrides applied, with your own credentials shown. For a profile that is already running, it is the revision that was activated: later edits appear here once you activate it again." = "捕获的源是你粘贴进来的内容。运行时是 macOS 实际运行的配置——已应用覆写——并显示你自己的凭据。对已经在运行的配置，它是当时激活的那个修订：之后的改动要再激活一次才会出现在这里。";
"The client downloaded remote provider data into the immutable profile revision before Core started." = "客户端在内核启动前，把远程集合数据下载进了不可变的配置版本。";
"The client runtime compiler is unavailable." = "客户端运行时编译器不可用。";
"The complete configuration text" = "完整的配置文本";
"The configuration cannot be empty." = "配置内容不能为空。";
"The configuration could not be activated. Try again." = "配置启用失败，请重试。";
"The configuration could not be imported." = "配置无法导入。";
"The configuration file exceeds the 16 MB import limit." = "配置文件超过 16 MB 导入上限。";
"The configuration is in use. Try again in a moment." = "配置正被占用，请稍后重试。";
"The configuration link does not contain a subscription URL." = "该配置链接不包含订阅 URL。";
"The configuration link does not contain a usable subscription address." = "该配置链接里没有可用的订阅地址。";
"The configuration resource structure is invalid." = "配置资源结构无效。";
"The configuration's top level is not a set of settings." = "这份配置的顶层不是一组设置。";
"The configured HTTP proxy does not allow CONNECT requests." = "所配置的 HTTP 代理不允许 CONNECT 请求。";
"The connection is started and stopped by iOS Network Extension." = "连接由 iOS 网络扩展启动与停止。";
"The connection is started and stopped by the macOS Network Extension." = "连接由 macOS 网络扩展启动与停止。";
"The connections stream is unavailable." = "连接数据流不可用。";
"The controller runs what your profile asks for: the API listens where you wrote it, and the bundled web UI is served, fetching itself once if the app has not already placed it. Two spellings are not carried over — the Windows named pipe, and the routing mark, which is a Linux socket option Darwin does not define." = "控制器按你的配置运行：API 在你写的地址上监听，内置面板也会提供；若 App 尚未预置面板，它会自行取回一次。两种写法不予沿用——Windows 命名管道，以及 routing mark（那是 Linux 的 socket 选项，Darwin 不定义）。";
"The copy was not created." = "副本没有创建。";
"The core accepts this configuration" = "内核接受这份配置";
"The core did not release this group's pin." = "内核没有释放这个分组的固定。";
"The core did not return an address." = "内核未返回地址。";
"The core did not return an address. Names cannot be resolved with these settings on this network." = "内核没有返回地址。在当前网络下，用这些设置无法解析域名。";
"The core honoured every field" = "内核照收了每一个字段";
"The core opens the listener the profile asks for. Only allow-lan needs a decision from the reader, because only it moves the listener off 127.0.0.1, so LAN Proxy Share carries the switch and the other ten arrive unconditionally." = "配置里要求什么监听，内核就打开什么。只有 allow-lan 需要你来决定，因为只有它会把监听从 127.0.0.1 挪到所有接口；开关放在「局域网代理共享」，其余十个字段无条件照收。";
"The core read the configuration above and answered without starting anything. Nothing is running." = "内核读了上面这份配置并作出回答，没有启动任何东西。当前没有在运行。";
"The core refused this configuration" = "内核拒绝了这份配置";
"The core refused this configuration." = "内核拒绝了这份配置。";
"The core refuses this configuration" = "内核拒绝这份配置";
"The core rejected the configuration structure or one of its fields." = "内核拒绝了该配置结构或其中的字段。";
"The core rejected this configuration: %@" = "内核拒绝了这份配置：%@";
"The core stopped on an internal error during its last run." = "内核在上次运行中因内部错误停止。";
"The core will refuse this configuration:" = "内核会拒绝这份配置：";
"The core's own notices, verbatim: what it removed, what it kept but cannot match, and anything it wants you to know about who can reach this device." = "内核自己的通知，逐字呈现：它移除了什么、保留了但匹配不到什么，以及任何它想让你知道的、关于谁能访问这台设备的事。";
"The core's own notices: what this platform removed from the runtime copy and why it is safe." = "内核自己的通告：本平台从运行副本移除了什么、为何安全。";
"The core's own words, unedited. Not everything here is the reason it stopped; these are the things it thought worth saying." = "内核的原话，未经改写。这里不是每一条都是它停下来的原因，而是它认为值得说出来的事。";
"The current path can run automatic updates." = "当前网络路径可运行自动更新。";
